        "description": "MINA: “I’ll be scrying you while you explore. I’m not coming in myself, but I’ll be watching closely.”\nMINA: “I can still send you messages through Menu when I need favors done.”\nMENU: “Between you and me, Mina seems excited.” \nMENU: She doesn’t show it like I do, but when it comes to not knowing the whole story, she gets just as frustrated. \nMINA: “I just said I’d be scrying you. That means watching and listening.” \nMINA: “But yes. I’m hoping to get some of my own questions answered inside.”\nMENU: “For me, it’s personal. I used to know things and someone took them away from me.”\nMENU: “Not only do I want to restore my data on the caves, I want to know who did this to me and why.”\nMENU: ”Then you can have your Kami eat them, I guess.”",
