        "name": "Into the Depths",
        "description": "MENU: “This cave system is much larger than my scans from the surface seemed to imply.”\nMENU:  “I know this is exactly what we were looking for, but this place…it intimidates me.”\nMINA: “Not getting cold feet now are you dear? I, for one, remain quite intrigued by these caverns.”\nMINA: “From what my initial scrying has revealed, I suspect they will contain many valuable resources.” \nMINA: “Perhaps even some clues relating to those garish looking office buildings outside.”\nMINA: “Is that not what you’re here to discover?”\nMENU: “Yeah, you’re right Mina. Sorry for being weird.”\nMENU: “We won’t know more until we collect more data, so you know what to do.”\nMENU: “Get your kami harvesting and let's see what turns up.”",
