      {
        "index": 38,
        "name": "Feeling in the Dark",
        "description": "MINA: “I was just thinking. At long last, I got you to take a shower.”\nMINA: “...”\nMENU: “...”\nMINA: “...”\nMENU: “Mina please.”\nMINA: “Fine, fine, just let me review the results of my latest scry, be patient.”\nMINA: “...”\nMINA: “I can see where your headache came from.” \nMINA: “Someone has been treating the sacred grounds of your distant forebears like it’s free real estate.”\nMENU: “I don’t know if you should really consider me related to them. Weren’t these temples made by humans?”\nMINA: “Of course they were. Why would that…?”\nMINA: “Ah..I see, of course. My mistake.”\nMENU: “So anyway, do you think whoever messed with this place is connected to the labs?”\nMINA: “Well, Since that is presently our only and most likely lead, we can proceed from the assumption that they are, at least for now.”\nMINA: “We won’t know more until we investigate the depths of their desecration.”\nMINA: “Operator, have your kami scavenge around and we’ll see what they have wrought.”",
